<h2>Pricing</h2>
<p>Get started with the most affordable social hub on the market. BitHub is free to try. Only Hubs which are published and hubded in your site will be charged.</p>

<div class="plans">
  <div class="plan plan-free">
    <h2>Free*</h2>
    <p>Aggregate and track your social media feeds</p>
    <hr>
    <ul>
      <li>Unlimited Social Feeds</li>
      <li>Manage multiple hubs</li>
      <li>Moderate your content</li>
      <li>Team user management</li>
      <li>Publically viewable hosted hub</li>
      <li>Social media analytics</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/register" class="btn-get-started">Get Started</a>
  </div>
  <div class="plan plan-paid">
    <h2>$7/mo.<small>per published hub</small></h2>
    <p>Hub your hub on your site</p>
    <hr>
    <ul>
      <li>Unlimited Social Feeds</li>
      <li>Manage multiple hubs</li>
      <li>Moderate your content</li>
      <li>Team user management</li>
      <li>Publically viewable hosted hub</li>
      <li>Social media analytics</li>
      <li class="important">Hub your hub publically anywhere on the web</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="/register" class="btn-get-started">Get Started</a>
  </div>
</div>

<p>We will charge you at the end of the month, based on how long each of your hubs was published. For instance if you were public for a duration of 3 days, we will charge you only for these 3 days. Minimum charging unit is 1 day.</p>
